852
01:06:32.355 --> 01:06:33.698
what does your name mean?

853
01:06:33.756 --> 01:06:35.997
Gyancho means someone
who is very intelligent.

854
01:06:37.093 --> 01:06:39.198
What can you teach us today?

855
01:06:39.261 --> 01:06:41.241
