856
01:06:42.031 --> 01:06:45.478
A man's world revolves
around his girl.

857
01:06:46.002 --> 01:06:48.312
And there are three
chapters to every girl.

858
01:06:48.504 --> 01:06:50.108
Chapter one...

859
