985
01:16:29.918 --> 01:16:33.627
I've been fighting with
every cop because of you.

986
01:16:34.156 --> 01:16:36.602
All cops are scoundrels!

987
01:17:07.856 --> 01:17:09.335
Remember what you had said?

988
